src/mikemol/buildtel/buildpulse.py|rate-in-seconds-not-minutes|mins = \(now\.at - ref\.at\) / SECONDS_PER_MINUTE|mins = now.at - ref.at|def=rate
src/mikemol/buildtel/buildpulse.py|freeze-dated-from-the-first-move|since = max\(moved\) if moved else None|since = min(moved) if moved else None|def=stalled
src/mikemol/buildtel/buildpulse.py|freeze-dated-from-the-newest-agreement|held = \(now\.at - min\(agreeing\)\)|held = (now.at - max(agreeing))|def=stalled
src/mikemol/buildtel/buildpulse.py|freeze-at-the-edge-not-a-stall|held \* SECONDS_PER_MINUTE >= stall_after|held * SECONDS_PER_MINUTE > stall_after|def=stalled
src/mikemol/buildtel/buildpulse.py|sample-at-the-move-counts-as-agreeing|and \(since is None or p\.at > since\)|and (since is None or p.at >= since)|def=stalled
src/mikemol/buildtel/buildpulse.py|no-history-stalled|if not past:|if past:|def=stalled
src/mikemol/buildtel/buildpulse.py|estimate-at-zero-rate|if per_min <= 0 or now\.total <= now\.done:|if now.total <= now.done:|def=eta
src/mikemol/buildtel/buildpulse.py|estimate-when-done|if per_min <= 0 or now\.total <= now\.done:|if per_min <= 0:|def=eta
src/mikemol/buildtel/buildpulse.py|hour-boundary-in-minutes|if mins >= MINUTES_PER_HOUR:|if mins > MINUTES_PER_HOUR:|def=eta

